        "segment": "Software engineering focuses on building software products and covers the full spectrum of activities involved in developing a software system, from the initial idea to the final product.",
        "citations": [
            {
                "type": "source_text",
                "content": "Moreover, software engineering design concepts tend to focus on general-purpose design principles, patterns, and criteria; advanced courses present design and analysis techniques that scale to large software systems.",
